// the Dreamworld house, houses and shops) and the people in them. The
// seven-light version of lit4.ps.hlsl. Built only for Project Sparrow
// (tools/shaders/build_replace.py --sparrow).
//
// Stage 1: a literal port of the game's Xenos microcode, generated by
// tools/shaders/ucode_port.py (comments give the ucode instruction numbers;
// reading notes in xe_common.hlsli). Same layout as lit4: tf0 albedo (alpha
// in .x), tf1 specular map, tf2 normal map, ambient c20 / c21 / c22, lights
// 0-3 c80..c83 (colours c87..c90, range c96, spot c98..c101 / c105 / c107 /
// c94, shadow slots c112 / c114) and lights 4-6 c84..c86 (colours c91..c93,
// range c97, spot c102..c104 / c106 / c108 / c95, shadow slots c113 / c115).
// Sparrow: GGX for all seven lights with the specular map as F0, the sky
// reflection, and on characters their materials (SparrowLitSpecular).
// Interiors have no sun map, so this works from the lamps alone.

